&lt;strong&gt;Item description:&lt;/strong&gt; A Caesar salad, no lettuce, on an edible soy-based plate.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Money entered:&lt;/strong&gt; 5 Wadōkaichin (Japanese currency dated to the 8th Century CE)&lt;br /&gt;
