&lt;p&gt;[&lt;span style=&quot;color: red&quot;&gt;JBREINER&lt;/span&gt;] Hello?&lt;br /&gt;
[&lt;span style=&quot;color: cyan&quot;&gt;GRRGRL&lt;/span&gt;] yo&lt;br /&gt;
[&lt;span style=&quot;color: red&quot;&gt;JBREINER&lt;/span&gt;] How are you all feeling, today?&lt;br /&gt;
