[&lt;span style=&quot;color: cyan&quot;&gt;GRRGRL&lt;/span&gt;] we&#039;ve talked a lot&lt;br /&gt;
[&lt;span style=&quot;color: cyan&quot;&gt;GRRGRL&lt;/span&gt;] how many people died&lt;br /&gt;
