[&lt;span style=&quot;color: cyan&quot;&gt;GRRGRL&lt;/span&gt;] good I mean&lt;br /&gt;
[&lt;span style=&quot;color: cyan&quot;&gt;GRRGRL&lt;/span&gt;] look I want a straight answer here&lt;br /&gt;
[&lt;span style=&quot;color: cyan&quot;&gt;GRRGRL&lt;/span&gt;] I think I already know the truth so&lt;br /&gt;
[&lt;span style=&quot;color: cyan&quot;&gt;GRRGRL&lt;/span&gt;] if you lie to me i&#039;ll know it, and we&#039;ll go back to being quiet again&lt;br /&gt;
[&lt;span style=&quot;color: cyan&quot;&gt;GRRGRL&lt;/span&gt;] so answer the next question truthfully. Ok?&lt;br /&gt;
[&lt;span style=&quot;color: red&quot;&gt;JBREINER&lt;/span&gt;] Ok.&lt;br /&gt;
[&lt;span style=&quot;color: cyan&quot;&gt;GRRGRL&lt;/span&gt;] besides the monster&lt;br /&gt;
[&lt;span style=&quot;color: cyan&quot;&gt;GRRGRL&lt;/span&gt;] did WE kill anyone? like, non&amp;#8230; monster-ppl&lt;br /&gt;
